{"seq":3,"slug":"dart-server-backend","title":"Dart 服务端开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/dart-server-backend","wordCount":1202,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"dart-服务端开发\">Dart 服务端开发</h1><p>Dart 不仅是 Flutter 的语言——它从诞生之初就包含 <code>dart:io</code> 库，可以直接编译为原生可执行文件运行服务端应用。2026 年的 Dart 服务端生态已相当成熟：<code>package:shelf</code> 提供中间件式 HTTP 框架、<code>dart_frog</code> 实现文件路由约定、<code>serverpod</code> 提供全栈 ORM 方案。AOT 编译产出的单文件可执行文件启动时间约 5ms，内存占用低于 20MB，适合容器化微服务部署。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先立起本篇的几张底牌，后文所有论证都围绕它们展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AOT 编译</td>\n<td><code>dart compile exe</code> 产出单文件原生可执行文件</td>\n<td>启动约 5ms、内存低于 20MB 的根源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shelf 抽象</td>\n<td><code>Request → Handler → Response</code> 的极简管道</td>\n<td>中间件式框架的共同底座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间件</td>\n<td><code>Handler → Handler</code> 的函数转换</td>\n<td>日志、CORS、鉴权等横切关注点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由约定</td>\n<td><code>dart_frog</code> 用文件系统映射 URL</td>\n<td>API 优先项目的组织方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接池</td>\n<td>复用数据库连接、限制并发与超时</td>\n<td>服务端数据访问的性能与稳定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Isolate 池</td>\n<td>把 CPU 密集任务分发到多个 worker</td>\n<td>不阻塞请求处理事件的并行手段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话串起来：AOT 编译给服务端轻量与快速启动，Shelf 的极简抽象统一了框架与中间件，路由与连接池决定请求如何被处理，Isolate 池决定 CPU 工作如何不阻塞事件循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dart-服务端的核心优势\">Dart 服务端的核心优势</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>对比优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AOT 编译</td>\n<td><code>dart compile exe</code> 生成单文件可执行</td>\n<td>启动 ~5ms，无冷启动问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前后端共享代码</td>\n<td>相同 Dart 模型类前后端复用</td>\n<td>消除 API 契约漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件循环 IO</td>\n<td>单线程 + 异步 IO 处理高并发</td>\n<td>类 Node.js，但有类型安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Isolate 并行</td>\n<td>CPU 密集任务不阻塞请求处理</td>\n<td>比 Worker Threads 更安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空安全</td>\n<td>编译期消除 null 错误</td>\n<td>减少运行时崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Dart 服务端应用] --&gt; B[dart compile exe]&#10;    B --&gt; C[单文件可执行]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Docker 容器]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Kubernetes 部署]&#10;    A --&gt; F[AOT 优化]&#10;    F --&gt; G[~5ms 启动]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&lt;20MB 内存]&#10;    F --&gt; I[无 JIT 预热]\">graph TD\n    A[Dart 服务端应用] --&gt; B[dart compile exe]\n    B --&gt; C[单文件可执行]\n    C --&gt; D[Docker 容器]\n    D --&gt; E[Kubernetes 部署]\n    A --&gt; F[AOT 优化]\n    F --&gt; G[~5ms 启动]\n    F --&gt; H[&lt;20MB 内存]\n    F --&gt; I[无 JIT 预热]</pre><h2 id=\"shelf-中间件式-http-框架\">Shelf：中间件式 HTTP 框架</h2><p><code>package:shelf</code> 是 Dart 服务端的基础抽象层，类似于 Node.js 的 Connect/Express 中间件模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;package:shelf/shelf.dart&#39;;&#10;import &#39;package:shelf/shelf_io.dart&#39; as io;&#10;import &#39;package:shelf_router/shelf_router.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;void main() async {&#10;  final router = Router()&#10;    ..get(&#39;/api/health&#39;, _healthHandler)&#10;    ..get(&#39;/api/users/&lt;id&gt;&#39;, _getUserHandler)&#10;    ..post(&#39;/api/users&#39;, _createUserHandler)&#10;    ..mount(&#39;/api/admin/&#39;, _adminRouter().call);&#10;&#10;  final pipeline = Pipeline()&#10;      .addMiddleware(logRequests())&#10;      .addMiddleware(corsMiddleware())&#10;      .addMiddleware(authMiddleware())&#10;      .addHandler(router.call);&#10;&#10;  final server = await io.serve(pipeline, &#39;localhost&#39;, 8080);&#10;  print(&#39;Server running on http://${server.address.host}:${server.port}&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;Response _healthHandler(Request request) {&#10;  return Response.ok(&#10;    jsonEncode({&#39;status&#39;: &#39;healthy&#39;, &#39;uptime&#39;: _uptime()}),&#10;    headers: {&#39;content-type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39;},&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;Future&lt;Response&gt; _getUserHandler(Request request, String id) async {&#10;  final user = await userRepository.findById(id);&#10;  if (user == null) return Response.notFound(&#39;User not found&#39;);&#10;  return Response.ok(jsonEncode(user.toJson()),&#10;      headers: {&#39;content-type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39;});&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:shelf/shelf.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:shelf/shelf_io.dart' as io;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:shelf_router/shelf_router.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final router = Router()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ..get('/api/health', _healthHandler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ..get('/api/users/&#x3C;id>', _getUserHandler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ..post('/api/users', _createUserHandler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ..mount('/api/admin/', _adminRouter().call);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final pipeline = Pipeline()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .addMiddleware(logRequests())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .addMiddleware(corsMiddleware())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .addMiddleware(authMiddleware())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .addHandler(router.call);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final server = await io.serve(pipeline, 'localhost', 8080);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('Server running on http://${server.address.host}:${server.port}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Response _healthHandler(Request request) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Response.ok(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    jsonEncode({'status': 'healthy', 'uptime': _uptime()}),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    headers: {'content-type': 'application/json'},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;Response> _getUserHandler(Request request, String id) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final user = await userRepository.findById(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (user == null) return Response.notFound('User not found');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Response.ok(jsonEncode(user.toJson()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      headers: {'content-type': 'application/json'});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Shelf 的核心抽象极简：<code>Request</code> → <code>Handler</code> → <code>Response</code>，中间件就是 <code>Handler</code> 到 <code>Handler</code> 的函数转换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Middleware</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Handler</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Handler</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Middleware}(h) = \\text{Handler} \\to \\text{Handler}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Middleware</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Handler</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Handler</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 自定义中间件：请求计时&#10;Middleware timerMiddleware() {&#10;  return (Handler handler) {&#10;    return (Request request) async {&#10;      final sw = Stopwatch()..start();&#10;      final response = await handler(request);&#10;      sw.stop();&#10;      return response.change(headers: {&#10;        &#39;X-Response-Time&#39;: &#39;${sw.elapsedMilliseconds}ms&#39;,&#10;      });&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;// CORS 中间件&#10;Middleware corsMiddleware({List&lt;String&gt; origins = const [&#39;*&#39;]}) {&#10;  return createMiddleware(&#10;    requestHandler: (request) {&#10;      if (request.method == &#39;OPTIONS&#39;) {&#10;        return Response.ok(&#39;&#39;, headers: _corsHeaders(origins));&#10;      }&#10;      return null; // 继续到下一个 handler&#10;    },&#10;    responseHandler: (response) {&#10;      return response.change(headers: _corsHeaders(origins));&#10;    },&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 自定义中间件：请求计时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Middleware timerMiddleware() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (Handler handler) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return (Request request) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final sw = Stopwatch()..start();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final response = await handler(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      sw.stop();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return response.change(headers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        'X-Response-Time': '${sw.elapsedMilliseconds}ms',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// CORS 中间件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Middleware corsMiddleware({List&#x3C;String> origins = const ['*']}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return createMiddleware(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    requestHandler: (request) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (request.method == 'OPTIONS') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Response.ok('', headers: _corsHeaders(origins));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return null; // 继续到下一个 handler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    responseHandler: (response) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return response.change(headers: _corsHeaders(origins));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"dart_frog-文件路由框架\">dart_frog：文件路由框架</h2><p><code>dart_frog</code> 提供 Next.js 风格的文件系统路由，适合 API 优先的项目：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"routes/&#10;├── index.dart          → GET /&#10;├── health.dart         → GET /health&#10;├── api/&#10;│   ├── users/&#10;│   │   ├── index.dart  → GET|POST /api/users&#10;│   │   └── [id].dart   → GET|PUT|DELETE /api/users/:id&#10;│   └── _middleware.dart → 应用于 /api/* 的中间件&#10;└── ws.dart             → WebSocket /ws\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>routes/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── index.dart          → GET /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── health.dart         → GET /health</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── api/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── users/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── index.dart  → GET|POST /api/users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── [id].dart   → GET|PUT|DELETE /api/users/:id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── _middleware.dart → 应用于 /api/* 的中间件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── ws.dart             → WebSocket /ws</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// routes/api/users/[id].dart&#10;import &#39;package:dart_frog/dart_frog.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;Future&lt;Response&gt; onRequest(RequestContext context, String id) async {&#10;  return switch (context.request.method) {&#10;    HttpMethod.get =&gt; _getUser(context, id),&#10;    HttpMethod.put =&gt; _updateUser(context, id),&#10;    HttpMethod.delete =&gt; _deleteUser(context, id),&#10;    _ =&gt; Future.value(Response(statusCode: 405)),&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;Future&lt;Response&gt; _getUser(RequestContext context, String id) async {&#10;  final repo = context.read&lt;UserRepository&gt;();&#10;  final user = await repo.findById(id);&#10;  if (user == null) return Response(statusCode: 404);&#10;  return Response.json(body: user.toJson());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// routes/api/users/[id].dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:dart_frog/dart_frog.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;Response> onRequest(RequestContext context, String id) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return switch (context.request.method) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    HttpMethod.get => _getUser(context, id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    HttpMethod.put => _updateUser(context, id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    HttpMethod.delete => _deleteUser(context, id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _ => Future.value(Response(statusCode: 405)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;Response> _getUser(RequestContext context, String id) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final repo = context.read&#x3C;UserRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final user = await repo.findById(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (user == null) return Response(statusCode: 404);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Response.json(body: user.toJson());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"数据库集成\">数据库集成</h2><p>Dart 服务端常用的数据库方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>postgres</code></td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>异步连接池、类型映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>drift</code></td>\n<td>SQLite/PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>类型安全 ORM、编译期查询校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>serverpod</code></td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>全栈 ORM + 代码生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>redis</code></td>\n<td>Redis</td>\n<td>缓存、Pub/Sub</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mongo_dart</code></td>\n<td>MongoDB</td>\n<td>文档数据库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;package:postgres/postgres.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;class DatabasePool {&#10;  late final Pool _pool;&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;void&gt; initialize() async {&#10;    _pool = Pool.withEndpoints([&#10;      Endpoint(&#10;        host: &#39;localhost&#39;,&#10;        port: 5432,&#10;        database: &#39;myapp&#39;,&#10;        username: Platform.environment[&#39;DB_USER&#39;] ?? &#39;postgres&#39;,&#10;        password: Platform.environment[&#39;DB_PASS&#39;] ?? &#39;secret&#39;,&#10;      ),&#10;    ], settings: PoolSettings(&#10;      maxConnectionCount: 10,&#10;      queryTimeout: Duration(seconds: 30),&#10;    ));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;List&lt;Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt;&gt;&gt; query(&#10;    String sql, [Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt;? params]&#10;  ) async {&#10;    final result = await _pool.execute(&#10;      Sql.named(sql),&#10;      parameters: params ?? {},&#10;    );&#10;    return result.map((row) =&gt; row.toColumnMap()).toList();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;void&gt; close() =&gt; _pool.close();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:postgres/postgres.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class DatabasePool {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late final Pool _pool;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;void> initialize() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _pool = Pool.withEndpoints([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Endpoint(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        host: 'localhost',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        port: 5432,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        database: 'myapp',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        username: Platform.environment['DB_USER'] ?? 'postgres',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        password: Platform.environment['DB_PASS'] ?? 'secret',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ], settings: PoolSettings(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      maxConnectionCount: 10,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      queryTimeout: Duration(seconds: 30),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;List&#x3C;Map&#x3C;String, dynamic>>> query(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    String sql, [Map&#x3C;String, dynamic>? params]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final result = await _pool.execute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Sql.named(sql),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      parameters: params ?? {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return result.map((row) => row.toColumnMap()).toList();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;void> close() => _pool.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"aot-编译与-docker-部署\">AOT 编译与 Docker 部署</h2><p>Dart AOT 编译产出的可执行文件无需 Dart SDK 运行环境：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"# 多阶段构建：编译阶段&#10;FROM dart:stable AS build&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY pubspec.* ./&#10;RUN dart pub get&#10;COPY . .&#10;RUN dart compile exe bin/server.dart -o bin/server&#10;&#10;# 运行阶段：最小化镜像&#10;FROM scratch&#10;COPY --from=build /runtime/ /&#10;COPY --from=build /app/bin/server /app/bin/server&#10;EXPOSE 8080&#10;CMD [&quot;/app/bin/server&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 多阶段构建：编译阶段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM dart:stable AS build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY pubspec.* ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN dart pub get</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY . .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN dart compile exe bin/server.dart -o bin/server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 运行阶段：最小化镜像</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM scratch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=build /runtime/ /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=build /app/bin/server /app/bin/server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>EXPOSE 8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CMD [\"/app/bin/server\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>产出的 Docker 镜像大小约 10-20MB（对比 Node.js 应用通常 100-300MB），启动时间约 5ms（对比 JVM 应用数秒）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能模型与-isolate-利用\">性能模型与 Isolate 利用</h2><p>服务端请求处理的性能模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 主 Isolate 处理请求路由和 IO&#10;// CPU 密集任务分发到工作 Isolate 池&#10;class WorkerPool {&#10;  final List&lt;SendPort&gt; _workers = [];&#10;  int _nextWorker = 0;&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;void&gt; initialize(int size) async {&#10;    for (var i = 0; i &lt; size; i++) {&#10;      final receivePort = ReceivePort();&#10;      await Isolate.spawn(_workerEntry, receivePort.sendPort);&#10;      _workers.add(await receivePort.first as SendPort);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;R&gt; execute&lt;R&gt;(dynamic task) async {&#10;    final port = ReceivePort();&#10;    _workers[_nextWorker++ % _workers.length]&#10;        .send((task, port.sendPort));&#10;    return await port.first as R;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  static void _workerEntry(SendPort mainPort) {&#10;    final port = ReceivePort();&#10;    mainPort.send(port.sendPort);&#10;    port.listen((msg) {&#10;      final (task, SendPort replyPort) = msg as (dynamic, SendPort);&#10;      final result = processTask(task);&#10;      replyPort.send(result);&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 主 Isolate 处理请求路由和 IO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// CPU 密集任务分发到工作 Isolate 池</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class WorkerPool {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final List&#x3C;SendPort> _workers = [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int _nextWorker = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;void> initialize(int size) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (var i = 0; i &#x3C; size; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final receivePort = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await Isolate.spawn(_workerEntry, receivePort.sendPort);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      _workers.add(await receivePort.first as SendPort);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;R> execute&#x3C;R>(dynamic task) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final port = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _workers[_nextWorker++ % _workers.length]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .send((task, port.sendPort));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return await port.first as R;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static void _workerEntry(SendPort mainPort) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final port = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mainPort.send(port.sendPort);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    port.listen((msg) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final (task, SendPort replyPort) = msg as (dynamic, SendPort);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final result = processTask(task);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      replyPort.send(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>请求处理的吞吐量模型：设单个请求的 IO 等待时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{io}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，CPU 处理时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{cpu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，事件循环的调度开销为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>QPS</mtext><mtext>single</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（IO 不阻塞事件循环）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{QPS}_{\\text{single}} \\approx \\frac{1}{t_{cpu} + \\epsilon} \\quad \\text{（IO 不阻塞事件循环）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0636em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">QPS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">single</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2935em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">IO </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不阻塞事件循环）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{cpu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过帧预算时，使用 Isolate 池将 CPU 工作分散到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个核心：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>QPS</mtext><mtext>parallel</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{QPS}_{\\text{parallel}} \\approx \\frac{N}{t_{cpu} + t_{msg}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0636em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">QPS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parallel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{msg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是消息传递的序列化开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产就绪清单\">生产就绪清单</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 优雅关闭&#10;ProcessSignal.sigterm.watch().listen((_) async {&#10;  print(&#39;Received SIGTERM, shutting down...&#39;);&#10;  await server.close();&#10;  await database.close();&#10;  exit(0);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 健康检查端点&#10;router.get(&#39;/health&#39;, (Request req) {&#10;  return Response.ok(jsonEncode({&#10;    &#39;status&#39;: &#39;ok&#39;,&#10;    &#39;version&#39;: packageVersion,&#10;    &#39;uptime&#39;: DateTime.now().difference(startTime).inSeconds,&#10;    &#39;memory&#39;: ProcessInfo.currentRss ~/ 1024 ~/ 1024,&#10;  }));&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 结构化日志&#10;void log(String level, String message, {Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt;? context}) {&#10;  final entry = {&#10;    &#39;timestamp&#39;: DateTime.now().toUtc().toIso8601String(),&#10;    &#39;level&#39;: level,&#10;    &#39;message&#39;: message,&#10;    if (context != null) ...context,&#10;  };&#10;  stdout.writeln(jsonEncode(entry));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 优雅关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ProcessSignal.sigterm.watch().listen((_) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('Received SIGTERM, shutting down...');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await server.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await database.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  exit(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 健康检查端点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>router.get('/health', (Request req) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Response.ok(jsonEncode({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'status': 'ok',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'version': packageVersion,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'uptime': DateTime.now().difference(startTime).inSeconds,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'memory': ProcessInfo.currentRss ~/ 1024 ~/ 1024,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 结构化日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void log(String level, String message, {Map&#x3C;String, dynamic>? context}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final entry = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'timestamp': DateTime.now().toUtc().toIso8601String(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'level': level,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'message': message,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (context != null) ...context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  stdout.writeln(jsonEncode(entry));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生产要素</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优雅关闭</td>\n<td>SIGTERM 信号监听 + 连接排空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康检查</td>\n<td><code>/health</code> 端点 + 就绪探针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化日志</td>\n<td>JSON 格式 + 日志级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标暴露</td>\n<td>Prometheus 格式 <code>/metrics</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置管理</td>\n<td>环境变量 + 分环境 YAML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密钥管理</td>\n<td>环境变量，不硬编码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Dart 服务端的核心优势是 AOT 编译出的单文件可执行产物：启动约 5ms、内存低于 20MB、无 JIT 预热，适合容器化微服务。</li>\n<li>Shelf 用 <code>Request → Handler → Response</code> 的极简抽象统一框架与中间件，中间件本质是 <code>Handler → Handler</code> 的函数转换，日志、CORS、计时代码都能复用同一模型。</li>\n<li><code>dart_frog</code> 以文件系统路由降低 API 项目的组织成本，<code>_middleware.dart</code> 控制作用范围。</li>\n<li>数据库访问以连接池为核心，<code>postgres</code>/<code>drift</code>/<code>serverpod</code> 覆盖从裸 SQL 到全栈 ORM 的不同抽象层级。</li>\n<li>部署走多阶段 Docker 构建：编译阶段产出可执行文件，运行阶段用 <code>scratch</code> 得到 10-20MB 的镜像。</li>\n<li>CPU 密集任务通过 Isolate 池分散到多核，<code>QPS</code> 模型显示并行化后吞吐近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N}{t_{cpu} + t_{msg}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4147em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>生产就绪清单覆盖优雅关闭（SIGTERM 排空连接）、健康检查、结构化 JSON 日志、指标暴露与密钥管理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"package-management-pub\">Pub 包管理与发布</a> 了解如何将服务端应用组织为可复用包，以及 <a href=\"testing-debugging\">测试与调试</a> 了解服务端应用的集成测试与负载测试策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Dart 服务端开发","id":"dart-服务端开发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Dart 服务端的核心优势","id":"dart-服务端的核心优势"},{"level":2,"text":"Shelf：中间件式 HTTP 框架","id":"shelf-中间件式-http-框架"},{"level":2,"text":"dart_frog：文件路由框架","id":"dart_frog-文件路由框架"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库集成","id":"数据库集成"},{"level":2,"text":"AOT 编译与 Docker 部署","id":"aot-编译与-docker-部署"},{"level":2,"text":"性能模型与 Isolate 利用","id":"性能模型与-isolate-利用"},{"level":2,"text":"生产就绪清单","id":"生产就绪清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"测试与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/testing-debugging"},"next":null}